
                        PT-Player 2.0

PT-Player will give you a nice GUI towards ptreplay.library.

It can be started from both shell and workbench and it will remove itself
from the shellwindow if necesery, then it opens a window on the deafult
public screen (most likly the workbench screen).

At the top of the window you have the name of the currently loaded module.
Under that you have to 2 numbers and a checkbox. Length is the length of
this module in number of positions, pos is the pos that is currently being
played and Loop tells you wheter this module should be looped of played
only once (to next EndOfModule mark actually).

Underneeth that you have 6 buttons which loads,plays,pauses, stops a module.